appendix_a.txt contains every encoded example in RFC 8949, Appendix A,
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8949.html#appendix-A, as hexadecimal.
The second column is the deterministic encoding expected by this exercise;
it is added by the iyi project and is not copied from the RFC. The original
examples include alternative float widths and indefinite-length items.

